{
  "Npcs.NamelessHorror.Desc": "A cyclopean abomination stands before you. It is a fifteen feet tall cone-like monstrosity, standing on a writhing mass of tentacles. Pitch black eyes cover most of its cone-like body in irregular patterns, and its 'face' is enclosed by a series of petal-like appendages. A series of tongues occasionally slither out of the enclosure, tasting the air."
  "Npcs.NamelessHorror.Name": "Nameless Horror"
}
